<title>INDIA: ANZ to lead $70 mln FRN for India's CESC.</title>
<headline>ANZ to lead $70 mln FRN for India's CESC.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-04-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>ANZ Investment Bank on Friday said it is to lead a $70 million floating rate note (FRN) issue for Indian utility firm CESC Ltd.</p>
</text>
